1 TITL Full-content certificate of the 1915 Carvalho Guimarães collective birth registration
1 TEXT A full-content certificate issued on 11 March 2025 transcribes record 38, book 4-A, page 23, registered on 12 October 1915. Francisco José de Carvalho Guimarães retrospectively registered six children born from 1901 through 1915 at Fazenda do Barroso, including Maria Amora Guimarães, born 1 January 1904. The record identifies his wife as Emmerenciana Maria de Jesus; his parents as Vicente José de Carvalho Guimarães, described only as Portuguese, and Maria Tertuliana da Conceição; and her parents as Antonio Francisco da Silva and Maria Paula de Jesus.
