1 TEXT A 1995 certified copy of Cidália's 1930 birth registration (nº 132, livro 2, fl. 142, Alvorada, Carangola, MG). Her own primary birth record: born 15 September 1930 at Alvorada, daughter of Antonio Engracio de Souza (P-0010) and Maria Aurora Guimarães (P-0011), declared by her father. Names the paternal grandparents Antonio Engracio de Souza + Luzia (Pinheiro) da Conceição (P-0032/P-0033) and the maternal grandparents Francisco José de Carvalho Guimarães + Emerenciana Maria de Jesus (P-0021/P-0022).
